{
	"title": "Comparer des masses",
	"description": "1 kg et 900 g ; 2 kg 100 g et 950 g ; la plus lourde et la plus légère de quatre masses",
	"grades": ["CE1"],
	"theme": "Grandeurs",
	"domain": "Masses",
	"subdomain": "Comparaison",
	"level": 2,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Compare ces deux masses.\n\n$$1~\\unit{kg} \\quad \\ldots \\quad {{b}}~\\unit{g}$$\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $<$\n- $=$\n- $>$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..20"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:50*k"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "eval:sign(1000-b)+1"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On écrit les deux masses dans la même unité : $1~\\unit{kg} = 1\\,000~\\unit{g}$.",
					"$$1\\,000~\\unit{g} {{if:r==0|<|{{if:r==1|=|>}}}} {{b}}~\\unit{g}$$",
					"$$1~\\unit{kg} \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:r==0|<|{{if:r==1|=|>}}}}} {{b}}~\\unit{g}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Compare ces deux masses.\n\n$${{a}}~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:50*p}}~\\unit{g} \\quad \\ldots \\quad {{eval:50*q}}~\\unit{g}$$\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $<$\n- $=$\n- $>$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "1..18"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "2..19"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["q>p"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "2"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"${{a}}~\\unit{kg}$, c'est déjà {{if:a==1|$1\\,000~\\unit{g}$|deux fois $1\\,000~\\unit{g}$}} : plus que ${{eval:50*q}}~\\unit{g}$.",
					"On ne compare pas seulement ${{eval:50*p}}$ et ${{eval:50*q}}$ : il faut compter les kilogrammes.",
					"$${{a}}~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:50*p}}~\\unit{g} \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{>} {{eval:50*q}}~\\unit{g}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Quelle est la masse la plus {{if:s==1|lourde|légère}} ?\n\n```choix\n- ${{n}}~\\unit{kg}$\n- $1\\,000~\\unit{g}$\n- $1~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:100*p}}~\\unit{g}$\n- $2~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:100*q}}~\\unit{g}$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "eval:s-1"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "3..50"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On compare d'abord les kilogrammes : $1\\,000~\\unit{g} = 1~\\unit{kg}$.",
					"$1\\,000~\\unit{g}$ fait $1~\\unit{kg}$ tout juste, $1~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:100*p}}~\\unit{g}$ un peu plus, $2~\\unit{kg}~{{eval:100*q}}~\\unit{g}$ plus de $2~\\unit{kg}$, et ${{n}}~\\unit{kg}$ encore plus.",
					"La plus {{if:s==1|lourde est **${{n}}~\\unit{kg}$**|légère est **$1\\,000~\\unit{g}$**}}."
				]
			}
		}
	],
